  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The B.O.B Control is a building unlocked at Builder Hall 9. The B.O.B Control does nothing when initially built and will only serve as a distraction. However, once upgraded to level 5, it enables the B.O.B's Hut to be built in the Home Village, allowing B.O.B to function there.",
    "Gearing up a Cannon, Archer Tower, and a Mortar in the Home Village. This requires a level 7 Cannon, a level 10 Archer Tower and a level 8 Mortar respectively in the Home Village, and a level 4 Double Cannon, a level 6 Archer Tower, and a level 8 Multi Mortar in the Builder Base.",
    "Upgrading any troop to level 18 (which requires Star Laboratory level 9).",
    "Upgrading any defensive building in the Builder Base to level 9.",
    "Upgrading the Battle Machine and Battle Copter to a combined level of 45."
  ],
  "notices": []
